<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <%- include('partials/seo-head') %>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <%- themeCSS %>
  <style>
    .tutorial-shell { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 70px 24px 90px; }
    .tutorial-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr .92fr; gap: 28px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 38px; }
    .tutorial-hero h1 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7vw, 5.4rem); line-height: .92; margin: 0 0 18px; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
    .tutorial-hero p { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 680px; }
    .tutorial-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 26px; }
    .tutorial-button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 20px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; }
    .tutorial-button.primary { background: var(--accent); color: #07110d; border-color: transparent; }
    .tutorial-player { border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); border-radius: 28px; background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(20,27,42,.96), rgba(8,12,20,.98)); box-shadow: 0 26px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.34); overflow: hidden; }
    .player-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: .82rem; }
    .player-dots { display: flex; gap: 6px; }
    .player-dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,.25); }
    .player-screen { min-height: 330px; padding: 28px; display: grid; align-content: space-between; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .player-screen:before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: -35%; background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(0,232,123,.16), transparent 35%), radial-gradient(circle at 80% 50%, rgba(100,150,255,.18), transparent 32%); animation: slowPan 9s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
    .screen-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .screen-step { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 800; font-size: .8rem; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .screen-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3.3rem); line-height: 1; margin: 12px 0; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
    .screen-caption { color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.6; }
    .screen-narration { position: relative; z-index: 1; padding: 16px; border-radius: 18px; background: rgba(4,7,12,.72); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); color: #eef6f1; line-height: 1.55; }
    .tutorial-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-top: 24px; }
    .tutorial-card { border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); border-radius: 22px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.045); padding: 20px; }
    .tutorial-card strong { display: block; color: var(--accent); font-size: .78rem; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .tutorial-card h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 1.35rem; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
    .tutorial-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.6; font-size: .95rem; }
    .tutorial-section { margin-top: 54px; }
    .tutorial-section h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); margin: 0 0 16px; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
    .checklist { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
    .check-item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr; gap: 12px; align-items: start; padding: 16px; border-radius: 18px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09); background: rgba(255,255,255,.04); }
    .check-mark { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 12px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(0,232,123,.12); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 900; }
    .check-item b { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .check-item span { color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.55; }
    @keyframes slowPan { from { transform: translate3d(-1%, -1%, 0) scale(1); } to { transform: translate3d(1%, 1%, 0) scale(1.05); } }
    @media (max-width: 920px) {
      .tutorial-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .tutorial-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 620px) {
      .tutorial-shell { padding: 46px 16px 70px; }
      .tutorial-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .player-screen { min-height: 300px; padding: 22px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/nav') %>
  <main class="tutorial-shell">
    <section class="tutorial-hero">
      <div>
        <h1>Your Autovyne signup walkthrough.</h1>
        <p>This quick overview shows the full path a new customer follows: run the live demo, sign up, choose payment, complete onboarding, and open the portal once Autovyne activates the account.</p>
        <div class="tutorial-actions">
          <a class="tutorial-button primary" href="/signup">Start Signup</a>
          <a class="tutorial-button" href="/demo">Try ROI + Live Demo</a>
          <a class="tutorial-button" href="/portal">Open Client Portal</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tutorial-player" aria-label="Autovyne signup video overview">
        <div class="player-top">
          <div class="player-dots"><span class="player-dot"></span><span class="player-dot"></span><span class="player-dot"></span></div>
          <span>Autovyne Tutorial</span>
        </div>
        <div class="player-screen">
          <div class="screen-content">
            <div class="screen-step">Step 01</div>
            <div class="screen-title">Start with the live demo.</div>
            <div class="screen-caption">See missed-call value, lead follow-up, and automation impact before filling out the signup form.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="screen-narration">Narration: "First, use the ROI and live demo page. This helps you understand what Autovyne is tracking before your account is activated."</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tutorial-grid" aria-label="Step-by-step signup overview">
      <article class="tutorial-card">
        <strong>Step 01</strong>
        <h2>Run the Demo</h2>
        <p>Use ROI + Live Demo to estimate missed revenue and understand what the AI workflow will help recover.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="tutorial-card">
        <strong>Step 02</strong>
        <h2>Create Signup</h2>
        <p>Enter the business owner details, phone number, website, industry, and SMS consent choice.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="tutorial-card">
        <strong>Step 03</strong>
        <h2>Choose Billing</h2>
        <p>Select automatic monthly subscription or manual billing so Autovyne knows how the account should be handled.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="tutorial-card">
        <strong>Step 04</strong>
        <h2>Activate Portal</h2>
        <p>After payment or approval, the portal opens with service status, onboarding updates, metrics, and help assistant access.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="tutorial-section">
      <h2>What customers see after signup</h2>
      <div class="checklist">
        <div class="check-item">
          <div class="check-mark">1</div>
          <div><b>Portal status</b><span>Customers can see whether their AI calling, SMS, CRM, and workflow automation services are pending, connected, or live.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="check-item">
          <div class="check-mark">2</div>
          <div><b>Onboarding progress</b><span>The account shows what Autovyne is setting up next, so new users are not left guessing after payment.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="check-item">
          <div class="check-mark">3</div>
          <div><b>Simple AI help</b><span>The customer assistant explains portal items, service status, and next steps without giving admin-only control.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="check-item">
          <div class="check-mark">4</div>
          <div><b>Industry-aware setup</b><span>The AI follows the same Autovyne workflow for every account, then adjusts wording and priorities for the customer industry.</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
